sketch_project_brief.bodyMarkdown:
The lifecycle-operations team needs a final customer follow-up report that can be handed directly to outreach.

You will build one query through four approvals:

1. identify customers in the eligible status set;
2. keep only real records that can be contacted by email;
3. focus the report on the approved cities and signup window;
4. apply the final name pattern, sort the result deterministically, and limit the handoff to five rows.

Each milestone starts from the exact approved query from the previous milestone. Preserve working requirements as the stakeholder adds the next rule.

